    'workshops_title' => 'Soter Workshops',
    'workshops_intro' => 'Soter & Partners organised its first courses in 1993. Immediately after being set up (January 1993), Soter S.R.L. obtained the authorisation to deliver the training sessions through which the Ministry of Finance wanted to implement the new accounting system. Accountants of the former regime were supposed to learn the capitalist evidence models, and Soter actively supported this change. Since then, courses, seminars, trainings and workshops have become part of the service portfolio for our clients. We organise tailor-made workshops and trainings on topics requested by our clients. They get to choose the areas they want to explore in depth, while we bring practical examples from their industries to complement the theory. No matter the topic or department involved, these professional events prepared by Soter & Partners specialists share the same differentiators:',
